  "releaseNotes": "Version 2027.1.1: Added date-aware ETI configuration for mid-year rate changes (March 2025 uses old rates, April 2025+ uses new rates). New ForPaymentDate() fluent API method. Replaced hardcoded ETI band check with UseRemunerationPercentage flag. 100% line coverage with 416 tests.",
